+    # answer cannot be OpenCode: that runtime needs a local inference server,
+    # and a host chosen for having no accelerator has none, so retrying there
+    # turns a recoverable rate limit into a confusing failure against a backend
+    # that was never running. The other subscription is the only real capacity
+    # left. Using it costs this role its independent reviewer, which is a
+    # degradation worth taking over a dead build and worth saying out loud.
